{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1b111359-3019-459a-9a7a-68111f691d82",
    "name": "VeterinariaGit - Web API JWT",
    "description": "Colección para probar los endpoints reales de VeterinariaGit. El login requiere los campos email y password. Configurar baseUrl (puerto local), email, password y mascotaId. Ejecutar primero Login para guardar jwtToken. La prueba 403 solo aplica a un JWT válido de un rol que NO sea Administrador, Empleado ni Veterinario; con los tres roles actuales no se puede demostrar 403 sin cambios. No exportar credenciales ni tokens reales al repositorio público.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "59199714",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/59199714-1b111359-3019-459a-9a7a-68111f691d82?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - obtener y guardar JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login exitoso (HTTP 200)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const token = data.token || data.Token || data.accessToken || data.access_token;",
                  "  pm.test(\"La respuesta contiene un token JWT\", () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);",
                  "  if (token) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwtToken\", token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
